{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a fully serverless REST API using Function Compute behind an API Gateway, with Tair for caching and Tablestore for data."}
{"t":"plan","products":["mobile-app","dns","esa","cloud-native-api-gateway","waf","fc","tair","tablestore","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"mobile-app","label":"Mobile app","group":"internet","why":"Native mobile clients calling the REST API."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the API domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-dns","from":"app","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates API traffic globally and provides DDoS defense."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-esa","from":"app","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"API VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes REST calls, handles auth and throttling."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"gateway","why":"Blocks injection attacks and bots at the gateway."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-gateway","from":"esa","to":"gateway","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"api","product":"fc","label":"API functions","group":"sg","why":"Serverless handlers that scale to zero, paying only per request."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-api","from":"gateway","to":"api","label":"HTTP"}
{"t":"say","text":"Tair caches hot responses to absorb spikes; Tablestore stores data serverlessly with no idle cost."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Response cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches frequent API responses to reduce cold starts and costs."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"tablestore","label":"Data store","group":"sg","why":"Serverless NoSQL storage billed per read/write, no idle charges."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-cache","from":"api","to":"cache","label":"read/write"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-db","from":"api","to":"db","label":"query"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralized logs and metrics for monitoring function invocations."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-logs","from":"api","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Serverless REST API on Function Compute behind Cloud-native API Gateway with WAF, ESA edge, Tair cache and Tablestore storage."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a Kubernetes architecture on ACK with MSE for discovery, an API gateway, RocketMQ, Tair cache and PolarDB."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","cloud-native-api-gateway","ack","mse","rocketmq","tair","polardb","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Clients","group":"internet","why":"External callers reaching the microservices."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the API domain to the ALB."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Microservices VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Ingress load balancer spreading traffic across zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Single entry point routing to 20 Java services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-gateway","from":"alb","to":"gateway"}
{"t":"node","id":"ack","product":"ack","label":"ACK Cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the 20 Java microservices on Kubernetes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-ack","from":"gateway","to":"ack"}
{"t":"node","id":"mse","product":"mse","label":"MSE Nacos","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Service discovery and configuration for all microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-mse","from":"ack","to":"mse","label":"discovery","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"mq","product":"rocketmq","label":"RocketMQ","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Async messaging between microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-mq","from":"ack","to":"mq","label":"events","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Tair Cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"In-memory cache for hot data and sessions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-cache","from":"ack","to":"cache"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"polardb","label":"PolarDB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Relational database with compute-storage separation."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-db","from":"ack","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS","group":"sg","why":"Centralized logs and traces for all services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-logs","from":"ack","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"ACK cluster with Cloud-native API Gateway, MSE Nacos, RocketMQ, Tair and PolarDB for 20 Java microservices."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a highly available two-zone online store in Singapore with ESA, ALB, WAF, auto-scaling ECS, Tair and PolarDB."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","tair","polardb","oss","sls","cloudmonitor"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Shoppers","group":"internet","why":"30k daily users browsing the store."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves store domain to ESA edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches static assets and accelerates dynamic traffic across Southeast Asia."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Store VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes traffic across two zones for high availability."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks OWASP attacks and bots before reaching the app."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the store backend across two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales out during big sales peaks automatically."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Sessions go to Tair and orders to PolarDB, both multi-zone for resilience."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Keeps carts and sessions fast with zone redundancy."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"polardb","label":"Orders DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores orders with compute-storage separation for peak scaling."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Product images","group":"sg","why":"Stores product images that ESA serves from edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-media","from":"esa","to":"media","label":"images"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes logs for troubleshooting and alerting."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"monitor","product":"cloudmonitor","label":"CloudMonitor","group":"sg","why":"Monitors metrics and triggers alarms during sales."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-monitor","from":"app","to":"monitor","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Two-zone HA store in Singapore: ESA edge, ALB with WAF, auto-scaling ECS, Tair cache, PolarDB, OSS and monitoring."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a RAG assistant that ingests your policy docs and wiki, embeds them into a vector store, and answers employee questions via Qwen."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","agentcore","model-studio","milvus","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"external","kind":"external","label":"Employees","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Employees","group":"external","why":"Staff asking policy and wiki questions."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"agentcore","product":"agentcore","label":"AgentCore","group":"sg","why":"Hosts the RAG agent, skills and MCP tools for employees."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-agentcore","from":"users","to":"agentcore","label":"questions"}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"sg","why":"Qwen models generate grounded answers from retrieved context."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-llm","from":"agentcore","to":"llm","label":"prompt"}
{"t":"node","id":"vector","product":"milvus","label":"Milvus","group":"sg","why":"Vector store holding embedded policy and wiki chunks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-vector","from":"agentcore","to":"vector","label":"search"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"OSS","group":"sg","why":"Stores raw policy PDFs and wiki exports for ingestion."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-docs","from":"agentcore","to":"docs","label":"ingest"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS","group":"sg","why":"Logs agent traces for auditing and improvement."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-logs","from":"agentcore","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"rec","product":"qwenwork","fit":"complement","why":"Ready-made workplace agent if you prefer no custom build."}
{"t":"done","summary":"RAG assistant on AgentCore with Model Studio Qwen, Milvus vector search, OSS document storage and SLS logging."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a real-time IoT telemetry pipeline in Singapore with anomaly alerts and a live dashboard."}
{"t":"plan","products":["iot-devices","iot-platform","kafka","flink","lindorm","datav","sls","smq"]}
{"t":"group","id":"external","kind":"external","label":"Field devices","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"devices","product":"iot-devices","label":"100k IoT devices","group":"external","why":"Sends telemetry every few seconds from the field."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"IoT VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"iot","product":"iot-platform","label":"IoT Platform","group":"sg","why":"Ingests MQTT telemetry from 100k devices and routes it to Kafka."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-devices-iot","from":"devices","to":"iot","label":"MQTT"}
{"t":"node","id":"kafka","product":"kafka","label":"ApsaraMQ for Kafka","group":"vpc","why":"Buffers high-throughput telemetry for stream processing."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-iot-kafka","from":"iot","to":"kafka","label":"telemetry"}
{"t":"node","id":"flink","product":"flink","label":"Realtime Compute Flink","group":"vpc","why":"Detects anomalies in real time over the telemetry stream."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-kafka-flink","from":"kafka","to":"flink","label":"stream"}
{"t":"node","id":"alerts","product":"smq","label":"Alert queue","group":"sg","why":"Decouples anomaly alerts for downstream notification."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-alerts","from":"flink","to":"alerts","label":"anomalies","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"tsdb","product":"lindorm","label":"Lindorm time series","group":"vpc","why":"Stores telemetry at scale for the live dashboard."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-tsdb","from":"flink","to":"tsdb","label":"metrics"}
{"t":"node","id":"dash","product":"datav","label":"Live dashboard","group":"sg","why":"Visualizes real-time metrics and anomaly counts."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-tsdb-dash","from":"tsdb","to":"dash","label":"query"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Log Service","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes pipeline logs and alert audit trails."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-logs","from":"flink","to":"logs","label":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"IoT Platform ingests 100k device streams into Kafka, Flink detects anomalies in real time, Lindorm stores metrics for a DataV dashboard, and SMQ queues alerts."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a data platform that replicates MySQL in real time via DTS, runs nightly batch in MaxCompute, and serves dashboards with Hologres and Quick BI."}
{"t":"plan","products":["rds","dts","hologres","maxcompute","dataworks","quick-bi","sls","users"]}
{"t":"group","id":"external","kind":"external","label":"Business users","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Analysts","group":"external","why":"Business users viewing dashboards."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Data VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"say","text":"Starting with the source order database and real-time replication."}
{"t":"node","id":"mysql","product":"rds","label":"Orders MySQL","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Source of truth for order transactions."}
{"t":"node","id":"dts","product":"dts","label":"DTS CDC","group":"sg","why":"Streams changes from MySQL to Hologres in real time."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-mysql-dts","from":"mysql","to":"dts","label":"CDC","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"hologres","product":"hologres","label":"Hologres warehouse","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Serves real-time analytics and dashboard queries."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dts-hologres","from":"dts","to":"hologres","label":"sync","kind":"async"}
{"t":"say","text":"Now adding nightly batch processing and orchestration."}
{"t":"node","id":"maxcompute","product":"maxcompute","label":"MaxCompute","group":"sg","why":"Runs heavy nightly batch SQL jobs over historical data."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-hologres-maxcompute","from":"hologres","to":"maxcompute","label":"nightly ETL","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"dataworks","product":"dataworks","label":"DataWorks","group":"sg","why":"Orchestrates nightly batch pipelines across MaxCompute and Hologres."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dataworks-maxcompute","from":"dataworks","to":"maxcompute","label":"schedule","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dataworks-hologres","from":"dataworks","to":"hologres","label":"backfill","kind":"control"}
{"t":"say","text":"Finally, dashboards for business users and logging."}
{"t":"node","id":"quickbi","product":"quick-bi","label":"Quick BI","group":"sg","why":"Interactive dashboards for business users over Hologres."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-quickbi-hologres","from":"quickbi","to":"hologres","label":"query","kind":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-quickbi","from":"users","to":"quickbi","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Central logging for pipelines and query audit."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-hologres-logs","from":"hologres","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-maxcompute-logs","from":"maxcompute","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"rec","product":"das","fit":"complement","why":"Autonomous tuning and anomaly detection for the source RDS MySQL."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Real-time MySQL replication via DTS into Hologres, nightly batch in MaxCompute orchestrated by DataWorks, and Quick BI dashboards."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw Express Connect from your on-prem data center to a Singapore VPC, plus SMC and DTS for step-by-step VM migration."}
{"t":"plan","products":["onprem-dc","express-connect","vpc","ecs","smc","dts","cloud-backup"]}
{"t":"group","id":"onprem","kind":"onprem","label":"On-premises DC (Singapore)","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"dc","product":"onprem-dc","label":"On-premises data center","group":"onprem","why":"Existing VMs and workloads to migrate gradually."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Cloud VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"ec-onprem","product":"express-connect","label":"Express Connect (VBR)","group":"onprem","why":"Private dedicated link from the data center into Alibaba Cloud."}
{"t":"node","id":"ec-cloud","product":"express-connect","label":"Express Connect (VPC)","group":"vpc","why":"Terminates the private link inside the cloud VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dc-ec","from":"dc","to":"ec-onprem","label":"private link"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ec-ec","from":"ec-onprem","to":"ec-cloud","label":"dedicated line"}
{"t":"node","id":"ecs","product":"ecs","label":"Migrated VMs","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Target ECS instances receiving migrated workloads."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ec-ecs","from":"ec-cloud","to":"ecs","label":"private traffic"}
{"t":"node","id":"smc","product":"smc","label":"Server Migration Center","group":"sg","why":"Incrementally replicates on-prem VMs to ECS in batches."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-smc-ecs","from":"smc","to":"ecs","label":"migration","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"dts","product":"dts","label":"DTS","group":"sg","why":"Keeps databases in sync during cutover with zero downtime."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dts-ecs","from":"dts","to":"ecs","label":"db sync","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"backup","product":"cloud-backup","label":"Cloud Backup","group":"sg","why":"Protects migrated VMs with scheduled backups once live."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ecs-backup","from":"ecs","to":"backup","label":"backup","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Express Connect links your Singapore data center to a cloud VPC; SMC migrates VMs incrementally and DTS syncs databases during cutover."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a live-streaming and VOD platform for e-sports fans in Singapore, using ApsaraVideo Live, VOD, ESA and OSS."}
